Third-party code and weights (each under its own license; not part of this repository except where noted):

* FLUX.2 [klein] 4B Base (black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-base-4B) and FLUX.2 [klein] 4B (black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-4B)
  are downloaded from Hugging Face at run time and are released under the Apache License 2.0.
* FLUX 3 Image Klein Base (black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-base) and FLUX 3 Image Klein
  (black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein) are downloaded from Hugging Face at run time and are released under Black
  Forest Labs' FLUX Kommunity License (non-commercial use).
* The files these repositories ship (VAEs, text encoders) come with the licenses stated there.
* BudgetLatent weights fine-tuned from one of these models are distributed under the license of that model.
* Black Forest Labs' reference implementations (github.com/black-forest-labs/flux2 and flux-3-image-klein, Apache
  License 2.0) are read by the parity checks in tests/ from a separate checkout and are not vendored, except three short
  functions of flux2's src/flux2/sampling.py (generalized_time_snr_shift, get_schedule, compute_empirical_mu; Copyright
  Black Forest Labs, Apache License 2.0, http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0), which
  tests/test_units_flux2_distilled.py carries as the fallback reference of its schedule check.
